    {
        "content": "<p>You'd probably have to take it apart into three statements all with goals of the form <code>A=0</code> before <code>nlinarith</code> would touch it but then I'd be cautiously optimistic</p>",
        "id": 617654013,
        "sender_full_name": "Kevin Buzzard",
